{
  "version": "4.0.0",
  "language": "en",
  "language_raw": "English",
  "source": "message/dat/English/script/common_2020_mushi_020.dat",
  "paired_tbl": "message/dat/English/script/common_2020_mushi_020.tbl",
  "matching": "TRAILING_MAX_SENTINEL",
  "entries": [
    {
      "ordinal": 0,
      "label": "common_2020_mushi_020_mushi_01",
      "hash64": "83DEAF0936B4C932",
      "text": "I remember your olive-rolling prowess very\\nwell, [VAR 0x0100(0000)].[VAR 0x0114(0016)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 49,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0100",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 54,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0016"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 1,
      "label": "common_2020_mushi_020_mushi_02",
      "hash64": "83DEAE0936B4C77F",
      "text": "You had such vigor—it was almost as if you had\\nTerastallized into a Fighting type yourself![VAR 0x0114(0016)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 91,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0016"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 2,
      "label": "common_2020_mushi_020_mushi_03",
      "hash64": "83DEAD0936B4C5CC",
      "text": "How many Gyms had you been to when you first\\ncame here to mine? Was it your first?[VAR 0x0114(0016)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 82,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0016"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 3,
      "label": "common_2020_mushi_020_mushi_04",
      "hash64": "83DEAC0936B4C419",
      "text": "The Cortondo Gym is close to the academy, so\\nmany young Trainers just starting out like to come\\r\\nhere first.[VAR 0x0114(0016)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 95,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 110,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0016"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 4,
      "label": "common_2020_mushi_020_mushi_05",
      "hash64": "83DEAB0936B4C266",
      "text": "With that in mind, La Primera asks me to go soft\\non Trainers—like a nice sponge cake.[VAR 0x0114(0016)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 85,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0016"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 5,
      "label": "common_2020_mushi_020_mushi_06",
      "hash64": "83DEAA0936B4C0B3",
      "text": "I feel sad for my sweet little bugs, though, since\\nthat means they quite often lose their battles.[VAR 0x0114(0016)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 98,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0016"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 6,
      "label": "common_2020_mushi_020_mushi_07",
      "hash64": "83DEA90936B4BF00",
      "text": "Hehe. But opportunities like this get me excited\\nbecause I can finally show my true skill.[VAR 0x0114(0016)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 90,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0016"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 7,
      "label": "common_2020_mushi_020_mushi_08",
      "hash64": "83DEB80936B4D87D",
      "text": "Allow me to knead you into submission![VAR 0x0114(0016)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 38,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0016"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 8,
      "label": "common_2020_mushi_020_mushi_09",
      "hash64": "83DEB70936B4D6CA",
      "text": "That was quite the battle. I must say that your\\nskill rivals that of even La Primera.[VAR 0x0114(0016)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 85,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0016"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 9,
      "label": "common_2020_mushi_020_mushi_10",
      "hash64": "83DBAA0936B28ADC",
      "text": "Ah! How sweet it is to battle without holding\\nback—even if I end up losing![VAR 0x0114(0016)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 75,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0016"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 10,
      "label": "common_2020_mushi_020_mushi_11",
      "hash64": "83DBAB0936B28C8F",
      "text": "I am beginning to think that going too soft on\\npeople may be no good for either party.[VAR 0x0114(0016)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 86,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0016"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 11,
      "label": "common_2020_mushi_020_mushi_12",
      "hash64": "83DBAC0936B28E42",
      "text": "My culinary teacher, Mr. Kofu, did tell me to put\\nmore of myself into my baking, after all.[VAR 0x0114(0016)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 91,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0016"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 12,
      "label": "common_2020_mushi_020_mushi_13",
      "hash64": "83DBAD0936B28FF5",
      "text": "I think I may try conducting battles in more of my\\nown style from now on![VAR 0x0114(0016)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 73,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0016"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 13,
      "label": "common_2020_mushi_020_mushi_14",
      "hash64": "83DBA60936B28410",
      "text": "If Trainers complain that the Cortondo Gym is\\nsuddenly more difficult, I’ll just tell them that\\r\\nnot all pastries are sweet![VAR 0x0114(0016)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 95,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 126,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0016"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 14,
      "label": "common_2020_mushi_020_mushi_15",
      "hash64": "83DBA70936B285C3",
      "text": "Good-bye for now. I hope to see you again\\nsomeday![VAR 0x0114(0016)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 50,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0016"
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
